@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
title MCTS 训练流水线

start
:加载目标模型 cnn_v7;
:加载训练样本;
:分割训练/验证集 (val_split);

repeat
  :打乱样本 (randperm);
  
  repeat
    :取出 batch {state, π, z};
    :_train_step 入口;
    note right
      T4 assert: p_log.max() <= 0
      T6 assert: v in [-1, 1]
      T11: value_fc.grad != 0
    end note
    :模型前向: (p_log, v) = model(state);
    :计算损失;
    note right
      l = (z - v)² - πᵀ·p_log
      p_log 是 LogSoftmax 输出
      不再取 log()
    end note
    :AdamW 反向传播 + 权重更新;
    note right: lr=0.001, weight_decay=1e-4
  repeat while (还有 batch?) is (是)
  -> 否;
  
  if (val 集存在?) then (是)
    :验证集评估 (无 grad);
    note right: model.eval() → 前向 T2-T9 → model.train()
  endif
  
  :输出日志: value_loss, policy_loss, total_loss;
repeat while (epoch 未完成?) is (是)
-> 否;

:保存模型权重 (state_dict);
stop
@enduml
